  <h2 id="gutermann-mara">Gütermann Mara</h2>
  <p>
    Gütermann Mara is an all-purpose thread we will use for most of our sewing: it is available in a large variety of weights, and its strength and
    smooth finish make this thread suitable for many applications.
  </p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Category</th>
          <th scope="col">Weights</th>
          <th scope="col">Best uses</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Very light</td>
          <td>Mara 220</td>
          <td>Fine seams and serging</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Lightweight</td>
          <td>Mara 150, Mara 120</td>
          <td>Fine garment sewing (blouses, swimwear, lingerie, other light clothing)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Medium (studio default)</strong> </td>
          <td><strong>Mara 100</strong></td>
          <td><strong>General sewing: garments, home textiles, and most studio soft goods</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Medium-heavy (studio default)</strong></td>
          <td><strong>Mara 70</strong></td>
          <td><strong>General-use medium-weight sewing when a bit more strength than Mara 100 is needed</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Heavy</td>
          <td>Mara 50, Mara 35, Mara 30</td>
          <td>Buttonholes, topstitching, leather goods, outdoor gear, upholstery</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Extra heavy</td>
          <td>Mara 15, Mara 11, Mara 8</td>
          <td>Leather, suitcases, tents, and other heavy projects</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="gutermann-mara-rpet">Gütermann Mara rPET (recycled PET)</h2>
  <p>
    Gütermann Mara rPET is comparable in strength, look, and feel to classic Mara, but it is made from <em>100% recycled
    materials</em>. Medium-weight Mara 100 rPET covers a wide range of uses (home textiles, apparel, etc), while
    heavier options such as Mara 50 rPET and Mara 30 rPET suit denser fabrics and harder-wearing products like
    upholstery, outdoor gear, and leather. Use Mara rPET when you want Mara performance with a recycled material
    path.
  </p>

  <h2 id="gutermann-tera">Gütermann Tera (abrasion-resistant)</h2>
  <p>
    Gütermann Tera is built for wear and abrasion resistance. High breaking strength and less
    fraying make it a good choice for canvas, leather, bike bags, backpacks and other high-friction sewing. Use Tera when the product will take more abuse than a standard apparel seam.
  </p>
